{"id":"v3i3f23tkf9kumga04lptt1go","title":"课堂上的手机管理","originalTitle":null,"summary":"作为一名一线教师，作者提出通过合理利用手机而非收缴手机来管理课堂。具体做法包括让学生将手机设为震动或静音，并在课堂上使用手机进行辅助教学和课外知识拓展。这种方法提高了学生的学习兴趣和参与度，获得了较高的学生满意度和教学质量评价。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=473924&do=blog&id=1561118"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T03:11:44.608Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T03:11:44.608Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":34,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}